# Generated OpenAPI reference — regenerated at build from
# ../../server/internal/app/openapi/openapi.yaml. Nothing in here is tracked:
# `gen-api-docs` runs cleanApiDocs first, which unlinks every *.json in the
# directory, so a checked-in _category_.json would be deleted on every build and
# leave the working tree dirty. The sidebar category is declared in sidebars.ts.
/docs/api/

